{"id":"16-235-11-14","zh":"意思是发出高声。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-236-2-6","zh":"kuñc，义为弯曲、变少。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-236-7-8","zh":"kuñcati（它弯曲）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-236-9-12","zh":"kuñcikā（钥匙）、kuñcitakeso（卷发的）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-236-13-14","zh":"kuñcitvā（弯曲之后）。","confidence":85}
