{"id":"16-238-2-4","zh":"añc，义为行走、供养。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-238-5-7","zh":"maggaṃ añcati（他走路）。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-238-8-10","zh":"buddhaṃ añcati（他供养佛陀）。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-238-11-16","zh":"不向上走而横着行走，所以叫作 tiracchāna（畜生）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-238-17-18","zh":"kaṭukañcukatā（吝啬）。","confidence":60}
