{"id":"16-240-2-5","zh":"guc、gaṇec，义为偷盗。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-240-6-10","zh":"偷取叫作 theyya，也就是盗窃。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-240-11-14","zh":"做这件事，就叫作 theyyakaraṇa（偷盗）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-240-15-16","zh":"gocati（他偷盗）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-240-17-18","zh":"gaṇecati（他偷盗）。","confidence":80}
